{'symbol': 'AZO', 'date': '2021-05-27 07:30:00', 'title': 'UNIQUE LOGISTICS INTERNATIONAL ADDS AUTOZONE INC. AS NEW CUSTOMER', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNIQUE LOGISTICS INTERNATIONAL, INC. (OTCMKTS: UNQL) ("UNIQUE" OR THE "COMPANY"), A GLOBAL LOGISTICS AND FREIGHT FORWARDING COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED A 12-MONTH OCEAN FREIGHT CONTRACT WITH AUTOZONE INC. (NYSE: AZO), A NEW CUSTOMER FOR THE COMPANY. UNDER THE TERMS OF THE AGREEMENT, THE COMPANY WILL SERVE AS AN OCEAN TRANSPORT AND LOGISTICS PROVIDER FOR AUTOZONE INC. FROM THE ASIA-PACIFIC REGION TO NORTH AMERICA THROUGH MAY 2022.'}{'symbol': 'AZO', 'date': '2021-05-27 07:30:00', 'title': 'UNIQUE LOGISTICS INTERNATIONAL ADDS AUTOZONE INC. AS NEW CUSTOMER', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNIQUE LOGISTICS INTERNATIONAL, INC. (OTCMKTS: UNQL) ("UNIQUE" OR THE "COMPANY"), A GLOBAL LOGISTICS AND FREIGHT FORWARDING COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED A 12-MONTH OCEAN FREIGHT CONTRACT WITH AUTOZONE INC. (NYSE: AZO), A NEW CUSTOMER FOR THE COMPANY. UNDER THE TERMS OF THE AGREEMENT, THE COMPANY WILL SERVE AS AN OCEAN TRANSPORT AND LOGISTICS PROVIDER FOR AUTOZONE INC. FROM THE ASIA-PACIFIC REGION TO NORTH AMERICA THROUGH MAY 2022.'}{'symbol': 'AZO', 'date': '2021-05-27 07:30:00', 'title': 'UNIQUE LOGISTICS INTERNATIONAL ADDS AUTOZONE INC. AS NEW CUSTOMER', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNIQUE LOGISTICS INTERNATIONAL, INC. (OTCMKTS: UNQL) ("UNIQUE" OR THE "COMPANY"), A GLOBAL LOGISTICS AND FREIGHT FORWARDING COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED A 12-MONTH OCEAN FREIGHT CONTRACT WITH AUTOZONE INC. (NYSE: AZO), A NEW CUSTOMER FOR THE COMPANY. UNDER THE TERMS OF THE AGREEMENT, THE COMPANY WILL SERVE AS AN OCEAN TRANSPORT AND LOGISTICS PROVIDER FOR AUTOZONE INC. FROM THE ASIA-PACIFIC REGION TO NORTH AMERICA THROUGH MAY 2022.'}